Package: MosqEditR
Type: Package
Title: Explainable Prioritization of Gene-Editing Targets in Anopheles gambiae
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dr. Oche George", "Ambrose", email = "ocheab1@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides reusable scoring, ranking, project-initialization, and
    reproducibility utilities for MosqEdit-R, an explainable framework for
    prioritizing candidate gene-editing targets in Anopheles gambiae by
    integrating biological evidence, positive-unlabeled model support, and
    CRISPR reference-sequence tractability. The package also ships templates
    for the manuscript analysis workflow. Large source datasets and frozen
    manuscript outputs are intentionally distributed separately.
